<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Computer Learning.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Computer Learning.</headline>
<text>
<p>LOS ANGELES - Robertson Stephens &amp; Co analyst Howard Block raised estimates on Computer Learning Centers Inc  based on the company's first quarter earnings.</p>
<p>- Block raised his 1998 EPS estimate from $0.91 to $0.98 and his 1999 estimte from $1.11/shr to $1.20/shr.</p>
